    "create_time": "2026-09-10 22:00",
    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第36篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">一直关注我的读者老师应该知道，8月初我测评过Running Hub</span><span style=\"color: rgb(95, 156, 239);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzY0MDM2MTExNQ==&amp;mid=2247485946&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ca2b1658804da774992b7261e179d9de&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"（点击查看8月原文）\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">（点击查看8月原文）</a></span></span><span leaf=\"\">，当时稳定的国风画风和高性价比的价格给我留下第一印象就蛮好。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近Running Hub又开始搞事情了，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">联动第十七届华语科幻星云奖、金瞳奖，正式开启RunningHub全球AIGC长片创作大赛。还请到刘慈欣老师担任顾问：</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section class=\"channels_iframe_wrp\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-videosnap class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card channels_iframe videosnap_video_iframe videosnap_video_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpvideosnap\" data-url=\"https://findermp.video.qq.com/251/20304/stodownload?encfilekey=KGDRibp2wkicLkxVIALz59259ibBkoM7CUicc5icw1z9iacPiclSO7RicvNFMgic2AOkRCTX8YguiaHia9LMEnE2nKnty0OCA&amp;token=6xykWLEnztKAgXibK0nXL0f3ia13RbBZnVxVt28HUB4NiaBzxxeg0QEe717icyUv75VAG2Y5daMwrrBBicvIE6uXicxKxWlibe9Bibh157Wulib3qicD0pHDZoZNQA2Wc4icuvo78nNa958M27gXQ5oot5YnoVDyOFpTsiatWbg6UabjMK1o9eicYBkicicXkfYdotk74e9nAsI2h8hmb1La8ETrKrdwhbByGgWNiaIT31DibJBvwc1t4TQs&amp;hy=SH&amp;idx=1&amp;m=&amp;scene=2&amp;uzid=1&amp;wxampicformat=503&amp;picformat=200\" data-headimgurl=\"https://wx.qlogo.cn/finderhead/naPHoFY2n5TlILkhXCTEcxuFRQDiaTuKVk2st3iahtbutk0ZkVr5b7yoU25kFOHb1oTV5UOwkGYok/0\" data-username=\"v2_060000231003b20faec8c4e48b18c4d6c705e836b0776216cd05e644eb6e65eec400188664e2@finder\" data-nickname=\"RunningHub\" data-desc=\"刘慈欣邀你，把想象拍成电影！\nRunningHub全球AIGC长片创作大赛现已开启，刘慈欣担任大赛顾问，单项最高100万元现金大奖，550万元总奖励池，10部科幻文学作品限时免费开放改编。\n从一支不少于2分钟的先导片开始，完成一部属于你的AI电影。\n #全球AIGC长片创作大赛 #RunningHub #刘慈欣 #AIGC #AI电影 #AI短片 #AI大赛 #runninghub\n\" data-nonceid=\"1828785297482854476\" data-authiconurl=\"https://dldir1v6.qq.com/weixin/checkresupdate/icons_filled_channels_authentication_enterprise_a2658032368245639e666fb11533a600.png\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"1440\" data-type=\"video\" data-id=\"export/UzFfBgAAxPauBB9xbxjEk8zT4DCLhSRQ4d4uX6DRCwUJMpOxpQ\"></mp-common-videosnap></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我一直很喜欢科幻小说，大刘的小说一部不落全看过。当初看的时候就会想，如果能把这些画面可视化，该多震撼。可除了《三体》和《流浪地球》等少量作品，大部分科幻小说很难等到专业团队拍成电影的。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近Running Hub迭代升级了，一个视频项目，就可以把十万字的科幻小说做成电影，我最近试着把星云奖获奖作家——董仁威的短篇科幻小说《智盾》做成电影，把其中一部分视频画面放出来，就当预告片吧，各位读者老师觉得效果如何？</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4688294300638658565\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4688294300638658565\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCkKIpRaD9QiclEH3mXgRoE01MoX2VVcFy5KOolNfM3c4MJSX7Qh9kouvRtNlKg3WKyssxNYtJKzL3FGFFtWVUcJAsKzCEfd4kSs%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7805555555555554\" data-w=\"1282\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果读者老师想把一部充满想象力的优秀作品，比如科幻小说给影视化，可以看我如何一步一步把小说做成电影。感兴趣的读者老师可以一起试试，还可以带着自己的作品参赛哦～</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkl3icngwXDDISXibVG5giayFrG0vsF3WIa3R1XcKZauQTkYPbY50xbqib3mnnTL2udjGb60eZIT0AauCx4WbyyA9TNwgCtbAK7wK0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.15121255349500715\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1402\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003776\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">把科幻小说做成电影</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">董仁威是知名的科幻作家，也是华语科幻最具影响力的奖项之一：全球华语科幻星云奖的创始人。我这次把他的小说《智盾》改成电影。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小说《智盾》的剧情，从世界生态危机开始，后来发现这是幕后黑手“暴君”利用人工智能与基因武器发动的攻击。之后一群有担当的科学家齐心协力，依托古老遗产“源典”晶体和文明智慧研制出“智盾”系统，最终解决了生态危机。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">以前将科幻小说拍成电影，需要先将小说改写成剧本，然后再制作拍摄脚本，再找演员和道具等拍摄，对于非专业人士来说，理解剧情、撰写脚本、拆分场次都有专业和资金的门槛，而且费时费力。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">可RunningHub的RHSTORY功能，把以上的门槛基本都去掉了。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003782\" data-ratio=\"0.9326347305389222\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmM9MSibicZH5rsLsGFywYhPh3NNkRsvKGZN2OtEDqfgO3HRUDHfnNUSo4pVMicQ5WXVDwN9wDPCOhjxCItq6J1NBBYbicxUHQmsS0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"668\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">首先往RHSTORY里导入小说原文，董仁威的《智盾》，全文大约9万5千字。RHSTORY理解文本的上限是10万字，短一些的小说可以轻松应对。长一些的，拆成多个也可以。RHSTORY可以去掉小说中的内心独白和叙事支线，将小说转化成适合影视化的剧本。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmOBaTnBFRISE3FJAHiaoHeiaxsiabRNgq7VomOvSichEuYaT59eZo5qrTiaJqq4ZNohZPUSsayHjFFMqsMicpsqpXKfib7ViauY7OTIjw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.9576719576719577\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"945\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003777\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大约十几分钟，9万多字的小说就分拆成了剧本，大约30集，每集2~5分钟，适合多种视频平台发布和传播。剧本如果不满意，是可以直接修改的，也可以自己先写，再导入到RHSTORY里面。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmia2qbSicSkqgtBxoKhQUl3KYU0O8s3CNjiag4rZLhhoicdk05aaBAeI1DbKxxupG1bClEYQKjichY0ibAZRroWFuoSzib2iaJmkdknUs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4958813838550247\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1214\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003775\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果对剧本满意了，就可以确定画风，RunningHub里面提供了上百种提前设定的画风。涵盖国风、写实、二次元、影视级风格。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClIFZ9cmPbawQ4nsMXYZ4EAcYF023ibABNKM6672Kl785A2hA1I1RtuChs0HDAMuATibE6PAzwBvadaXZZgA87zdDcKUedRttqcg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6171875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003791\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后是按照画风和剧本，生成角色、场景和道具。RHSTORY会自动识别和归类，如果一个角色或场景出现在好几集里，那每一集都会引用同一个角色和场景，保持前后的统一。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmkdba7hMYUhYTG7HGdpZPfNPxN5XPC8QuFbbgu9uRYuSRZaxdOOHRWzrnNjpNuOoJ4LeNibNpH2BeoTNP4f2QvNT51UmLk1vXQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5890625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003787\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">角色、场景和道具的生成，都可以修改提示词或上传参考图。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmiaP6C0udNpdBlpjncMBKRyJsjS3cHstKmf6prcBnVl2to66GD7ZtibG7A811ib3xj8XBWsa0QjicAXhRAkEE64b8978JCylGtg9M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.553125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003789\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">然后是生成分镜，RHSTORY里面用的Seedance2.5模型，对于景别切换、运镜、时长节奏等等，已经是专业级别的把控。不熟悉视频制作的可以用自动生成的分镜提示词创作，老手可以自己导入分镜剧本。比如这个科幻片的分镜剧本，角色、场景、道具和台词都清晰的标注出来了。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClOfe2JOaAHX4HsANPXCY9IgVdsicJ59H5e7FRYiaC8Ha2xhy2rPyPRNGClmoAyAkDFeUdy0HgR5ibk5tGpdian2caVKDhx3nicksGU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.66875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003783\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">分镜生成之后，可以在线预览。尤其震惊我的，是这一段画面，女主角有一大长段独白，记得之前的视频AI，长段独白很容易读错，需要反复修改，这个一遍就通过了。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnJZSZYDNyn8SWHYDFv2dQjic9jZsaPbYqj3MHXniaQAO5WNY5dY8G4r5bzuDz3EWLPicuECXt2hLsXWdxY08FJ74XJA8bias81PfQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.53671875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003788\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果对某几秒钟的画面不满意，可以选取片段，做“片段重拍”，不需要重新生成整段画面。而且对于制作动画的开销，是以人民币为单位，显示在右下方按钮旁边的，制作成本一目了然。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmoB49e9gmGRGBibWI23ndZTA1fkQeHTTibj61fgpjiapiadGtjTXbrwhLtSTa3jFTsHackYhDtyiaNPUbQLj6P75Lvo2rfgOuONcZ4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.93046875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003793\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></sectio