space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RunningHub联动第十七届华语科幻星云奖、金瞳奖，开启的全球AIGC长片创作大赛，是全球首个聚焦影视级长片创作的AIGC赛事，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">不同于侧重画面展示的AIGC短片赛事，本次大赛重点发掘具备世界观、完整叙事和长片生产能力的电影及长剧项目。</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmoQ1v4c3C8iaO4W65g2iaDqianuB5AvmuwG2Nubo5fb9piaQMU1GMPtIz7U4Sdg4ljDia9EJTKWe5olzAAGey68mfhPx1QUP2biaGXU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.54296875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100003792\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">为了支持本次大赛，</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">10部科幻文学IP限时开放改编授权</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，给各位视频创作者提供顶级的创作灵感。这次科幻影片就是改编其中《智盾》的情节。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B